                                "sense_id": "caa80cb5-827d-3f6a-9b0b-7b1dca10c7bc",
                                "text": "Patients received 600 mg/day of ritonavir (Abbott Laboratories) for 14 days, after which were added 600 mg/day of zidovudine (Retrovir, Glaxo-Wellcome) and 6 mg/day of zalcitabine (Hivid, Roche) with treatment maintenance for 12 months."
